        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/dms3rep/multi/02+1.jpg\" alt=\"\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           The pre-season netball tournament wrapped up on Sunday, April 13, at Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa\u2019s \u014ctaki campus.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Pre-sales were at an all time high with all sessions being sold out prior to the games. It was an extremely busy weekend with all sessions having maximum attendance.\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           It was a fantastic weekend celebrating women in sport. More than just about winning, the weekend was about coming together as teams, creating meaningful connections, and embracing new experiences. On Saturday evening, the teams shared a special whakawhanaungatanga session, where they learned a new waiata composed by the late Sam Doyle, led beautifully by Sam\u2019s daughters.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <a href=\"https://youtu.be/7zEuIUo69LQ\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           Click here\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            to view the video\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Here\u2019s to an exciting season ahead - wishing all the teams the very best as they chase success and give it their all!\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
